{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">31 Room is a shooter puzzle game that challenges your brain and also your reflexes. Combining physics-based mechanics and strategic mind, the game gives you a fulfilling combination of problem-solving and skill.<br><br>Unravel the mystery between the AI (you) and the developers (Nawaf &amp; Mohammed). As you proceed, you get new tools with more complexity in puzzles along with more rewards for solving them. <br><br>Designed for two players only, 31 Room is a co-op game\u2014you can't play by alone. Play with a buddy or drop into a random lobby to get through the challenges as a team. (In-game voice chat isn't supported.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617320?t=1745519568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617320?t=1745519568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617320/b68ccc7095dbe72a87c479e0d618ffee7ae740fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745519568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617320/b68ccc7095dbe72a87c479e0d618ffee7ae740fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745519568","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">31 Room is a shooter puzzle game that challenges your brain and also your reflexes. Combining physics-based mechanics and strategic mind, the game gives you a fulfilling combination of problem-solving and skill.<br><br>Unravel the mystery between the AI (you) and the developers (Nawaf &amp; Mohammed). As you proceed, you get new tools with more complexity in puzzles along with more rewards for solving them. <br><br>Designed for two players only, 31 Room is a co-op game\u2014you can't play by alone. Play with a buddy or drop into a random lobby to get through the challenges as a team. (In-game voice chat isn't supported.)</p>","developers":["mastie_studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617320/177e1e8f6c165200d955fb24703997d742d1c88f/header.jpg?t=1745519568","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"31 Room","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100F / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["mastie_studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"3 May, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_fu